exports[`requester emails snapshots > Filed for each eligibility > filed problem report 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>[FRQ-123] Filed: Push/pull by 0 mm removes the face</title></head>
<body style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;max-width:40em;margin:1em auto;padding:0 1em">
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Your problem report was filed with PushForm as FRQ-123.</p>
<p><strong>Identifier:</strong> FRQ-123<br><strong>Title:</strong> Push/pull by 0 mm removes the face<br><strong>Kind:</strong> Problem<br><strong>Filed by:</strong> ada@example.com</p>
<h2>What happens next</h2>
<p>The team will review your report in Linear and may ask questions by email.</p>
<h2>What I did</h2>
<p>1. Open a model<br>2. Push/pull a face by 0 mm</p>
<h2>What I expected</h2>
<p>Nothing changes.</p>
<h2>What happened</h2>
<p>The face disappears &amp; the &lt;model&gt; breaks.</p>
<h2>How often</h2>
<p>Always</p>
<h2>Area</h2>
<p>Modeling</p>
<h2>Impact</h2>
<p>Cannot work</p>
<h2>Environment</h2>
<p>Build: 0.4.2 (abc1234)<br>Browser: Firefox 150<br>OS: macOS 26<br>Document type: model<br>Time: 2026-10-23T10:00:00.000Z</p>
<p>This email is about request FRQ-123 only.</p>
<p>Questions for the team: reply to support@pushform.io.</p>
</body></html>
",
  "subject": "[FRQ-123] Filed: Push/pull by 0 mm removes the face",
  "text": "Hello,

Your problem report was filed with PushForm as FRQ-123.

Identifier: FRQ-123
Title: Push/pull by 0 mm removes the face
Kind: Problem
Filed by: ada@example.com

What happens next
-----------------

The team will review your report in Linear and may ask questions by email.

What I did
----------

1. Open a model
2. Push/pull a face by 0 mm

What I expected
---------------

Nothing changes.

What happened
-------------

The face disappears & the <model> breaks.

How often
---------

Always

Area
----

Modeling

Impact
------

Cannot work

Environment
-----------

Build: 0.4.2 (abc1234)
Browser: Firefox 150
OS: macOS 26
Document type: model
Time: 2026-10-23T10:00:00.000Z

This email is about request FRQ-123 only.

Questions for the team: reply to support@pushform.io.
",
}
`;

