exports[`requester emails snapshots > Ready to try, Updated trial, Reminder, Expired > ready to try 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>[FRQ-123] Ready to try: Layout: nudge viewports with arrow keys</title></head>
<body style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;max-width:40em;margin:1em auto;padding:0 1em">
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>A trial of your request FRQ-123 is ready.</p>
<p><strong>Identifier:</strong> FRQ-123<br><strong>Title:</strong> Layout: nudge viewports with arrow keys<br><strong>Round:</strong> 1</p>
<h2>What was built</h2>
<p>Arrow keys now nudge the selected Layout viewport by 1 mm; Shift moves 10 mm.</p>
<h2>Deliberately left out</h2>
<ul><li>Nudging several viewports at once.</li></ul>
<h2>Try it</h2>
<p><strong>Trial address:</strong> https://frq-frq-123-layout-nudge.pushform-app.pages.dev<br><strong>Sign in with:</strong> ada@example.com<br><strong>Trial closes:</strong> 2026-10-26 12:00 UTC (2 days and 23 hours from now)</p>
<p>The trial uses separate trial data: your production documents are not there and nothing you do in the trial changes them. The trial closes 24 hours after you give a verdict, or at the time above, whichever comes first.</p>
<h2>Trial script</h2>
<ol><li>Open the sample Layout document from the feedback panel.</li><li>Select the viewport on page 1 and press Right.</li><li>Check that the viewport moved 1 mm to the right.</li></ol>
<p>Use the feedback panel inside the trial to report what you find and to give your verdict; that is the way results reach the team.</p>
<p>This email is about request FRQ-123 only.</p>
<p>Questions for the team: reply to support@pushform.io.</p>
</body></html>
",
  "subject": "[FRQ-123] Ready to try: Layout: nudge viewports with arrow keys",
  "text": "Hello,

A trial of your request FRQ-123 is ready.

Identifier: FRQ-123
Title: Layout: nudge viewports with arrow keys
Round: 1

What was built
--------------

Arrow keys now nudge the selected Layout viewport by 1 mm; Shift moves 10 mm.

Deliberately left out
---------------------

- Nudging several viewports at once.

Try it
------

Trial address: https://frq-frq-123-layout-nudge.pushform-app.pages.dev
Sign in with: ada@example.com
Trial closes: 2026-10-26 12:00 UTC (2 days and 23 hours from now)

The trial uses separate trial data: your production documents are not there and nothing you do in the trial changes them. The trial closes 24 hours after you give a verdict, or at the time above, whichever comes first.

Trial script
------------

1. Open the sample Layout document from the feedback panel.
2. Select the viewport on page 1 and press Right.
3. Check that the viewport moved 1 mm to the right.

Use the feedback panel inside the trial to report what you find and to give your verdict; that is the way results reach the team.

This email is about request FRQ-123 only.

Questions for the team: reply to support@pushform.io.
",
}
`;

